  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><span>Dear all，</span><br style=\"\" /><span>【宝剑炼化</span><span>】活动下发资源，现申请相关配置。</span><br style=\"\" /><br style=\"\" /><br style=\"\" /><span>辛苦&nbsp;</span><span>@叶导</span><span>&nbsp;审批，</span><br style=\"\" /><span>辛苦&nbsp;</span><span>@灿灿</span><span>&nbsp;配置。</span></p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 48.0pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>礼物名称</td><td>价格</td><td>礼物ID</td><td>bbid</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>画戟</td><td>5000钻</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>风雷画戟</td><td>10000钻</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>龙魂画戟</td><td>20000钻</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><span>以上，如有问题及时沟通～</span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p>",
      "representation": "storage",
